<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Write</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>write &lt;paper&gt;
write &lt;headline&gt;      (at a board)
</pre>
<p>Examples:
</p>
<pre>write paper
write Selling a fine long sword
</pre>
<p>Writes a note or a letter on a piece of paper you carry; no pen is 
needed. The editor opens, as for any longer text: type your lines, and end 
with @ on a line of its own. The paper must be blank: once something is 
written on it, it stays.
</p><p>In a post office you don't even need paper: write, and you grab a piece 
from the Post Office. Then give it to the postman to mail it to another 
player (see <a cmd='#'>Help Mail</a>).
</p><p>Where there is a board, in the room or in your hands, write followed by a 
headline posts a message on it instead (see <a cmd='#'>Help Boards</a>). Some boards 
want you to be level 10 or more before you post.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Mail</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Boards</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Read</a>
</pre>




</div>